effect.name=Recreates AviUtl1 glow.\n
PI=- `strength`: Strength\n- `diffusion`: Diffusion\n- `threshold`: Threshold\n- `speed`: Diffusion speed\n- `light_color`: Light color (`0xRRGGBB`, or `false` to use source chroma)\n- `fixed_size`: Fixed size (`true` / `false`)\n
